  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Features\n\n- Controls:\n  - Wrapper around `Window` exposing `Width`, `Height` and `Position` for more declarative windowing, and automatically generating a `TitleBar`\n  - Wrapper around `SelectorBar` and `SelectorBarItem` to allow for more declarative navigation with the `To` property\n  - Wrapper around `NavigationView` and `NavigationViewItem` to allow for more declarative navigation with the `To` and `SettingsPage` properties\n- Markup:\n  - Markup extension to simplify using string resources in XAML\n- Windowing:\n  - Structure for more customization of the window's position with both coordinates and centered\n\nKnow issues\n\n- Markup:\n  - `StringResourceExtension`: Doesn't work when used without specifying the parameter name.",
